      "docs": "Process an input key event routed through unrealscript from another object. This method is assigned as the value for the\nOnReceivedNativeInputKey delegate so that native input events are routed to this unrealscript function.\n@param\tControllerId\tthe controller that generated this input key event\n@param\tKey\t\t\t\tthe name of the key which an event occured for (KEY_Up, KEY_Down, etc.)\n@param\tEventType\t\tthe type of event which occured (pressed, released, etc.)\n@param\tAmountDepressed\tfor analog keys, the depression percent.\n@return\ttrue to consume the key event, false to pass it on."
